{
  "component": "p10",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "WHERE ARE THE LITTLE BREADS MARKED SERVE, SHOW AND\nTOAST?",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "I SERVED THEM.",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "IN THAT ORDER?",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 4,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "I HANDED THEM ROUND. I WASN'T SUPERVISING THE\nCHEWING.",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "THOSE WERE MY SEQUENCE REMINDERS.",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 6,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU BAKED THE PLAN, JACKIE. IT SMELLED FINISHED.",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 7,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "CRUMBS. I SHOULD HAVE KNOWN SOMETHING WAS WRONG\nWHEN PEOPLE COMPLIMENTED THE SCHEDULE WITH THEIR\nMOUTHS FULL.",
      "record_id": "P10.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE: FEED THE CONTRIBUTORS. SHOW: RITA PRESENTS\nHER PANEL, WHEN SHE IS READY. TOAST: MAKE AND\nRECORD COMMITMENTS.",
      "record_id": "P10.READ.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 10,
      "header_entry": 9,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "CERAMIC SAMPLE TILES",
      "record_id": "P10.LABEL.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 12,
      "header_entry": 11,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE WIPE-CLEAN CERAMIC TILES. I CAN WRITE ON\nTHESE WITHOUT ASKING ANYONE TO SPIT THE\nINSTRUCTIONS OUT.",
      "record_id": "P10.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "CUE RACK",
      "record_id": "P10.LABEL.002",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 14,
      "header_entry": 11,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE BUILT-IN SPRING CLIPS. TILES OR FLAT CARDS\nFIT. NOTHING HAS TO BE TIED TO A GUEST.",
      "record_id": "P10.LOOK.003",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 15,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "RITA'S THREE SAMPLE TILES. WIPE-CLEAN, AND MUCH\nHARDER TO BUTTER BY MISTAKE.",
      "record_id": "P10.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE",
      "record_id": "P10.CHOICE.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 11,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOW",
      "record_id": "P10.CHOICE.002",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 11,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "TOAST",
      "record_id": "P10.CHOICE.003",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 11,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "WORD AND MATCHING PICTURE, CLEARLY MARKED. IT RUBS\nOFF IF I GET IT WRONG.",
      "record_id": "P10.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 20,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE, SHOW, TOAST. FEED EVERYONE, LET RITA\nPRESENT, THEN MAKE THE PROMISES. WRITTEN DOWN.\nCLIPPED IN. NOT BAKED.",
      "record_id": "P10.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 21,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT ONE DOESN'T TELL US WHAT TO DO. WHICH WORD\nFROM FRANKIE'S PLAN GOES THERE?",
      "record_id": "P10.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT WOULD REVEAL RITA'S WORK BEFORE DINNER. THE\nBOARD SAYS FEED EVERYONE FIRST.",
      "record_id": "P10.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "TOAST COMES AFTER DINNER AND RITA'S PRESENTATION.\nI'M NOT MAKING HUNGRY PEOPLE LISTEN TO HOW\nGENEROUS I'VE BEEN.",
      "record_id": "P10.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "FLAT CARD WORKS TOO. THE RACK'S OWN CLIPS HOLD IT.\nFINALLY, I'VE PRINTED SOMETHING TOO THIN TO BE A\nBISCUIT.",
      "record_id": "P10.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 26,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "RITA'S TILES. MY FIRST DURABLE MENU.",
      "record_id": "P10.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "TRY NOT TO TOAST THE CERAMICS.",
      "record_id": "P10.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 28,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "FROM NOW ON, BREAD IS FOR EATING. I'LL KEEP THE\nSCHEDULE ON THE BOARD.",
      "record_id": "P10.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "GOOD. IF IT NEEDS MY ATTENTION INSTEAD OF MY\nAPPETITE, DON'T BAKE IT.",
      "record_id": "P10.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE, SHOW, TOAST. FOOD FIRST. RITA'S REVEAL WHEN\nSHE IS READY. COMMITMENTS LAST. THE CUE RACK CAN\nBE READ AND CORRECTED.",
      "record_id": "P10.READ.002",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 32,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "RECOVER THE ORDER, THEN WRITE IT ON SOMETHING\nNOBODY WILL EAT.",
      "record_id": "P10.HINT.1",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "FRANKIE'S BOARD HAS THE SEQUENCE. RITA'S SAMPLE\nTILES WIPE CLEAN; FLAT MASTER CARD ALSO FITS THE\nRACK.",
      "record_id": "P10.HINT.2",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 36,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "WRITE SERVE, SHOW AND TOAST ON THE TILES OR CARD.\nCLIP THEM INTO THE CUE RACK IN THAT ORDER.",
      "record_id": "P10.HINT.3",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 37,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "WHERE ARE THE LITTLE BREADS MARKED SERVE, SHOW AND\nTOAST?",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "I SERVED THEM.",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 922
    },
    {
      "text": "IN THAT ORDER?",
      "record_id": "P10.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 211,
      "entry": 4,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 922
